# ==========================================================================
#  Ashok DevOps Portfolio — Environment Configuration
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Copy this file to `.env` and edit the values. Every piece of personal
#  data on the site is read from here (or from src/data/*.js). You should
#  NEVER need to edit UI / component code to update your details.
#
#  All variables MUST start with `VITE_` so Vite exposes them to the browser.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Identity -------------------------------------------------------------
